<title>UK: PSK sets 200 mln Swiss franc five-year bond.</title>
<headline>PSK sets 200 mln Swiss franc five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   OESTERREICHISCHE POSTPARKASSE</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN SFR   COUPON     2.75	MATURITY    10.SEP.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.20    PAY DATE    10.SEP.97</p>
<p> LISTING    SWISS     DENOMS (K) FIVE	NEG PLG     YES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
